[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://tl_date_level_3"]

; Level 3 — the date venue.
;
; Deliberately bare. Round 3 has no trap phase and no walkable objectives yet:
; TurnManager loads this, parks Player 2 in it, and immediately opens the trait
; lob minigame (trait_lob_minigame.gd) on the HUD layer, which covers the whole
; screen. This scene only has to be a plausible dim room behind that overlay and
; to keep Player 2 inside walls while it plays.
;
; Dress it like levels/office.tscn when the date gets walkable content: add a
; Background Sprite2D with painted venue art, tables as StaticBody2D + Area2D
; props, and the date NPC.

